      "review_description": "Nepean Solar Solutions delivered “A Total Solar Solution” for me.From the best simple question on first contact with Jim and his team , “Why do you want to install solar?”, to installing a quality solar system and then when asked to help me find the best “following the sun concept”,  Nepean Solar Solutions delivered on a first class TOTAL Solar Solution for me. For me the most important part of the total solution was the Quality of Installation, attention to details and Service on which Nepean Solar Solutions ticketed all three boxes and are full accredited.To Jim and the all the team at Nepean Solar Solutions, thank you for your quality of service on all parts of our engagement, and I know my Solar System performance  is in good hands with your ongoing monitoring service.5 Star Quality Service",
