      "review_description": "We moved into our house around 8wks ago and started talking about solar pretty much straight away. I did some research and came across Jim and the team at Nepean Solar Solutions. From the moment of first contact, I could see that Jim was the man for the job. He showed genuine interest in what we were seeking and spoke from a tradesmans background rather than a salesman.Jim put together a number of options for us in a professionally presented folder and we eventually decided on a large 13.2kw system. A week or so later, Jims two young installers turned up on time and well presented. They took extreme care around our home and over two days did an amazing job of installing our system., with Jim himself doing the final commissioning. Since that time, our expectations have been thoroughly met and usually exceeded with the panels and inverter producing more than we hoped for.All in all, we are very happy with the job and wouldn't hesitate to recommend Jim and the team at Nepean Solar Solutions if you are considering a rooftop solar system. Their work is truly top notch and all done very professionally at a price that won't break the bank. You will not be disappointed.",
